{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "48d5ef533556c0ea3c5d04e9d4dea281bc4812e10a7b3748b37394c71d138a50", "ja": "ギャル学講座！　服飾学", "zh": "辣妹学讲座！服饰学", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c0090b7edb9134ee865b48c75b4c0973c6c31d071061510f6e6477963b3ac864", "ja": "ギャル語を学び終えた一同は、次にギャル風\nコーデに挑戦！　まずはファッションについ\nてのお勉強……というところに、ギャルには\n全く詳しくないひなたが合流、一緒に学んで\nいくことに。", "zh": "学完辣妹用语后，大家接下来要挑战辣妹风穿搭！首先要学习时尚方面的知识……就在这时，对辣妹完全不了解的日向加入进来，决定和大家一起学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "34b9d8c8310ca3d44fe1208df4b255137676da4d72691e0984f09e1a3570250f", "ja": "うっうー！　みんなと勉強して、ちょっとだけ\nギャルのことがわかってきましたー！", "zh": "呜呜—！和大家一起学习之后，我稍微有点\n懂辣妹是怎么回事了—！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "77bf0c795d27ca2960ac2db0db0e19e9a081f6b0c6202d44347dcaa84a8f455c", "ja": "杏奈も！　好きピと一緒なら勉強だって余裕？\nビビッとあざまるです☆", "zh": "杏奈也是！只要和喜欢的人一起，学习也能轻松搞定？\n超有感觉，谢啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "2388c56a50ce50cb3e7bbfb9056cea09ed9921fe5c98b24efba07089cda91c4c", "ja": "おけまるですよーっ♪　えっと、そしたら次は……\nギャル講習、ファッション編だって！", "zh": "没问题啦——♪ 那么接下来是……  \n辣妹讲座，时尚篇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "5f647aca88a6c97fa4277efe683e03ba1d1d5d7dcd05afda57edc80ff8a4d260", "ja": "むう～っ、それも難しそう……ギャル風の\nコーデって、もうひとつのジャンルみたいだし。", "zh": "唔～，那个看起来也好难……辣妹风的搭配，感觉就像是另一个领域一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "6fd99ee5341ace34da05af0f314affeafabdcea94897190e1b852e84ef0740cb", "ja": "うんうん、奥が深そうだよね……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉这里面学问很深呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "80c0430453497c5cd83b09f344c723b0eb95b6aacac7c943d344e5d2aa8000dd", "ja": "ふたりとも、ちょっこしいいかい？\nギャルの勉強、あたしもご一緒させてもらえんかなぁ？", "zh": "你们两个，能不能稍微加我一个呀？\n关于辣妹的学习，也让我一起参加，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "20fc518e52fe75540e15a0f47c93cac1dc379446db75e8e628cd3e50fe77ec4b", "ja": "あっ、ひなたちゃん！　もちろんいいよ。\n一緒にお勉強しましょー！", "zh": "啊，日向！当然可以呀。\n一起学习吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "c9f0e97ed9385ee9af235341d048d1af273d990442c25d48237fee718616290a", "ja": "ありがとさんです。あたし、ギャルの服装が\nよくわかんなくって、困ってたんだわぁ。", "zh": "谢谢你。我一直搞不太懂辣妹的穿搭，正犯愁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "04f5e568f70cdcaa0d87339a88e3d2183b4c44c832fa1e0893a039e42cf457de", "ja": "だよね！　アイドルのメイクとか\n衣装ならわからなくもないけど、それとも違うし。", "zh": "对吧！偶像的妆容和服装什么的，我还算懂一点，但这又不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "55d1456c4bba129836279e3d86d62ace6028b5fb958b123e53cbeaa78fae7e1c", "ja": "こういう時は、お手本があるとよさそうだけど……\nうーん……あっ、そうだ！", "zh": "这种时候，要是有个范本就好了……\n嗯……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "21e04658f65854d37e6e4e3ee34c25be399675b8f34b398be566e8f612505f11", "ja": "ふたりの学校のクラスとかに、ギャルの人っていない？\nもしいたら、思い出してみるといいのかも！", "zh": "你们两人的班级里，有没有辣妹之类的人？\n如果有的话，不妨回想一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "be155edb4fc9ce5b9815af17c1ccdfada47ac846f1964a11c89e13346c7982f1", "ja": "あ、杏奈のクラスにいるよ！　ええと……\nつけまつげとかカラコンとかしてて、カッコいい系の！", "zh": "啊，杏奈的班上就有一个！呃……\n戴着假睫毛和彩色隐形眼镜，是那种很帅气的类型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "b3b409016b60bdea63de8e75671477f369c397504c3c98bf5398df4da2cd63ce", "ja": "あんまり意識したことなかったけど……いたねぇ。\nシャツの襟もとを、ゆるく開けてる感じだったべさ！", "zh": "没怎么注意过，不过……确实有一个来着。感觉她把衬衫领口松松地敞开着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "06a89103148052547c68137fcc3890cc3f162cb4d9c7fe282dd881314b2504e9", "ja": "ふむふむ～……ギャルって、爽やかだけど、\nちょっとお色気！　みたいなことなのかも？", "zh": "嗯嗯～……所谓辣妹，可能就是清爽中又带点性感的感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0312_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0312_story_02_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "6fee6ad9a915c9f60e9118afac9ae596465b29e9047deb67266d3c052b984bed", "ja": "あ、なんかわかってきたかも！\nこんな感じで、もっとお話し聞いてみましょー！", "zh": "啊，我好像有点明白了！\n就照这个感觉，再多听听大家的说法吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
